[Music]  hey everyone welcome to another  installment of harry potter theory in  today's video we're discussing hogwarts  professor minerva mcgonagall  minerva mcgonagall is a scottish  half-blood witch that attended hogwarts  school of witchcraft and wizardry we  know a lot about her past her love  interests her career path her parents  thanks to extra publications from  rowling but one important aspect about  her character remains unclear her age  you see her age is subject to a  considerable amount of speculation and  this is because in fantastic beasts 2  the crimes of grindelwald we see a young  woman by the name of mcgonagall at  hogwarts a woman who if i had to guess  is in her 20s or so  we know that mcgonagall teaches  alongside dumbledore and we know that at  one point she's a young professor at the  school so what's the problem well all of  this would be fine if it had been  consistent with what jk rowling had  revealed about mcgonagall in the  original series originally rowling  stated that mcgonagall started teaching  at the school in 1956 at the age of 21.  however fantastic beast 2 takes place in  the year 1927  29 years before she's supposed to have  taught there which just doesn't really  add up expanding on this if she really  had started at the school in 1956 at the  age of 21 then it means that she was  born in the year 1935.  this adds to the confusion even more as  that seven or eight years after she's  seen on screen  harry potter cannon also supports  rowling's claim that mcgonagall began  teaching there in 1956.  in a 1995 conversation between umbridge  and mcgonagall mcgonagall reveals that  she had been working at hogwarts 39  years this december which is consistent  with what rowling had said initially in  the most recent trailer for fantastic  beasts 3 the secrets of dumbledore we  see young mcgonagall once again warning  dumbledore about something pertaining to  the imminent threat that is gelet  grindelwald so what on earth is going on  well the first thing i want to address  is that mcgonagall we've seen so far has  not yet been referred to by her first  name the mcgonagall from the harry  potter series is minerva and at this  point this new mcgonagall has no link to  that name  at least not from within the film this  has led some fans to the conclusion that  this mcgonagall must be minerva's mother  but i've got a big wrench to throw in  that theory you see the published  screenplay for the film contradicts this  entire argument as it's clearly shown  that this is in fact minerva and no  maneuver wasn't named after her mother  her mother was isabelle ross  on top of all of that minerva's father  who she got the mcgonagall name from was  a muggle which means there's no large  wizarding family that shares the  mcgonicle name  this eliminates other prospects like  distant relatives cousins etc  so what does all of this mean how can  mcgonagall be teaching at hogwarts  school before she's even born i'd like  to imagine that there is some convoluted  explanation for breach of canon perhaps  involving a time turner or alternate  dimensions but i think the harsh reality  here is that this is no carefully chosen  plot twist but instead is an attempt to  shoehorn a popular character like  mcgonagall back into the story am i  happy that canon is broken certainly not  but i must admit i'd be lying if i said  that i wasn't happy to see a fan  favorite like mcgonagall slotted back  into the story  if you guys want to know the full  backstory of minerva mcgonagall from her  birth to her life after the battle of  hogwarts then check out my video in the  pinned comment what do you guys think  how is mcgonagall's presence in  fantastic beasts explained leave a  comment down below  until next time remember  differences of habit and language are  nothing at all if our aims are identical  and our hearts are open  you

